SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaIntro::
    .string "I had a vision of your arrival.\p"
    .string "I am SABRINA.\n"
    .string "SAFFRON CITY's GYM LEADER.\p"
    .string "You kept your mind steady within\n"
    .string "POKéMON TOWER's astral pull.\p"
    .string "I have had psychic powers since\n"
    .string "I was a child.\p"
    .string "It started when a spoon I\n"
    .string "carelessly tossed, bent.\p"
    .string "I dislike battling, but if you wish,\n"
    .string "I will show you my powers!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaDefeat::
    .string "This loss shocks me!\n"
    .string "But, a loss is a loss.\p"
    .string "I admit, I didn't work hard enough\n"
    .string "to win.\p"
    .string "Your victory has earned you the\n"
    .string "MARSHBADGE.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaPostBattle::
    .string "Psychic power isn't something that\n"
    .string "only a few people have.\p"
    .string "Everyone has psychic power.\n"
    .string "People just don't realize it.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaPostFieldVictory::
    .string "POKéMON TOWER's astral pressure\n"
    .string "has settled.\p"
    .string "The MARSHBADGE is proof that your\n"
    .string "mind held firm within it.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ExplainMarshBadgeTakeThis::
    .string "A calm mind earns trust from\n"
    .string "even strong outsider POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Keep completing PROF. OAK's\n"
    .string "subquests to strengthen that bond.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedMarshFinderFromSabrina::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the MARSH FINDER\n"
    .string "from SABRINA.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ExplainMarshFinder::
    .string "The MARSH FINDER senses hidden\n"
    .string "objects nearby.\p"
    .string "A calm mind can notice what the\n"
    .string "eyes alone overlook.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "SABRINA's POKéMON use psychic\n"
    .string "power instead of force.\p"
    .string "FIGHTING POKéMON are especially\n"
    .string "weak against PSYCHIC POKéMON.\p"
    .string "They'll get destroyed before they\n"
    .string "can even aim a punch!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideSabrinaAway::
    .string "SABRINA left for POKéMON TOWER\n"
    .string "after feeling a psychic pull\l"
    .string "toward it.\p"
    .string "She said it was likely the\n"
    .string "gathering of a massive amount\l"
    .string "of astral energy.\p"
    .string "I'd better head there myself.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideSabrinaStillAway::
    .string "SABRINA is at POKéMON TOWER,\n"
    .string "drawn there by astral energy.\p"
    .string "Bring her a POKéMON that can\n"
    .string "learn DREAM EATER.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideSabrinaReturned::
    .string "SABRINA is back from\n"
    .string "POKéMON TOWER!\p"
    .string "She said you held steady inside\n"
    .string "a powerful astral current.\p"
    .string "Want some advice before you\n"
    .string "challenge her?$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyFocusYourMind::
    .string "All right!\n"
    .string "Focus your mind!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyShowSabrina::
    .string "All right!\p"
    .string "Then go show SABRINA what you\n"
    .string "learned in POKéMON TOWER!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory::
    .string "I witnessed your victory in\n"
    .string "POKéMON TOWER. Well done!\p"
    .string "SABRINA is back in her chamber.\n"
    .string "Speak with her about friendship\l"
    .string "and how it changes POKéMON.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "SAFFRON POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: SABRINA\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "SAFFRON POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: SABRINA\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_OrinIntro::
    .string "Focus your thoughts.\n"
    .string "Now, focus your team!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_OrinDefeat::
    .string "You gave me something\n"
    .string "new to learn!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_OrinAfter::
    .string "A calm mind can learn\n"
    .string "even from defeat.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_AldenIntro::
    .string "These rooms test direction.\n"
    .string "I test concentration.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_AldenDefeat::
    .string "You gave me something\n"
    .string "new to learn!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_AldenAfter::
    .string "The shortest path is not\n"
    .string "always the clearest one.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SilasIntro::
    .string "Can you read my next move?\n"
    .string "Let us find out.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SilasDefeat::
    .string "You gave me something\n"
    .string "new to learn!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SilasAfter::
    .string "Prediction still needs practice.\n"
    .string "Bring your VS SEEKER next time.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_MiraIntro::
    .string "SABRINA values a steady mind.\n"
    .string "Show me yours in battle.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_MiraDefeat::
    .string "You gave me something\n"
    .string "new to learn!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_MiraAfter::
    .string "Our training continues\n"
    .string "while SABRINA is away.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SeleneIntro::
    .string "Close out the noise.\n"
    .string "Listen to your POKéMON.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SeleneDefeat::
    .string "You gave me something\n"
    .string "new to learn!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SeleneAfter::
    .string "Trust makes it easier\n"
    .string "to understand one another.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_LyraIntro::
    .string "A clear mind and a loyal team.\n"
    .string "That is my kind of strength.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_LyraDefeat::
    .string "You gave me something\n"
    .string "new to learn!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_LyraAfter::
    .string "Come back with your VS SEEKER.\n"
    .string "There is always more to learn.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaGiftChingling::
    .string "SABRINA: Your calm presence\n"
    .string "earned this CHINGLING's trust.\p"
    .string "I would like you to take it\n"
    .string "with you on your journey.$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedChinglingFromSabrina::
    .string "{PLAYER} received CHINGLING\n"
    .string "from SABRINA!$"

SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaChinglingAdvice::
    .string "CHINGLING already feels close\n"
    .string "to you. Nurture that friendship.\p"
    .string "When its bond is strong enough,\n"
    .string "it can evolve into CHIMECHO\l"
    .string "by leveling up at night.$"
